  "title": "Asian-Style Chicken and Vegetables",
  "description": "Seasoned chunks of chicken are stir-fried with broccoli, bell peppers, and mushrooms. Cubes of jicama add a nice crunch to this savory, sweet dish.",
  "authors": [
    "JENISSE"
  ],
